  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/slim-fire/banner.png\" alt=\"Slim Fire 橫幅\"></p><h2><strong>描述</strong></h2><p>減少火焰覆蓋層佔用的視覺空間！<br>\n非常適合 PvP 或日常遊戲！</p><p>唯一官方支援 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soul Fire'd</a> 以及所有其他使用它的模組的資源包！</p><ul>\n<li><strong>原版</strong>：<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/slim-fire/imgs/fire-comparison.png\" alt=\"Slim 火焰\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/slim-fire/imgs/lava-comparison.png\" alt=\"Slim 熔岩\"></li>\n<li><strong>Soul Fire'd</strong>：<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/slim-fire/imgs/soul-comparison.png\" alt=\"Slim 靈魂\"></li>\n<li><strong>Soul Fire'd</strong> + <strong>Oh the Biomes You'll Go</strong>：<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/slim-fire/imgs/boric-comparison.png\" alt=\"Slim 硼酸\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/slim-fire/imgs/cryptic-comparison.png\" alt=\"Slim 神秘\"></li>\n</ul><h2><strong>許可證與使用權</strong></h2><p>隨意在任何模組包或影片中使用此模組，只需確保給予 credit 並可能連結到<a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/slim-fire#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。<br>\n本項目根據 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/slim-fire/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crystal Nest Community License v1</a> 發布。</p><h2><strong>支持我們</strong></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Crystal Nest 官方網站\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcrystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Ko-fi\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/kofi/kofi512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"我們的其他專案\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fcrystal-nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/modrinth/modrinth512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crystalspider/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/curseforge/curseforge512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcrystalspider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d559b544-474c-4109-b861-1b2e6ca6026a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect 主機\"></a></p>",
